        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FoMO is an experimental first-person horror about paranoia, decay, and routines rotting before your eyes.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up. Work. Drink. Sleep.<br>Something broke, and now everything is wrong.<br>The apartment reeks of mold.<br>The bar is empty like a grave.<br>The office became a living maze that keeps shifting… and watching you.<br>No weapons.<br>No control.<br>Only escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FoMO is a suffocating horror focused on strangeness, sensory tension, and constant pursuit. Every run is unpredictable thanks to randomized mazes, nothing repeats, nobody escapes the same way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run. Hide. Endure the silence. Watch reality bend around you. The retro 3D pixel look isn’t nostalgia, it’s decay. Everything feels wrong. You’re trapped in a warped version of your own life. And a small decision can make everything worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental first-person horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird, decaying, unpredictable atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized mazes (every escape is unique)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on pursuit, evasion and hiding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distorted, uncomfortable retro visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound that amplifies paranoia and tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear narrative with consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily life turned into a nightmare</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/extras/95502aa2296edd681383391f4019394c.poster.avif?t=1771522941\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/extras/95502aa2296edd681383391f4019394c.webm?t=1771522941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/extras/95502aa2296edd681383391f4019394c.mp4?t=1771522941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does FoMO mean?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It stands for “Fear of Missing Out,” the anxiety that you’re missing out on exciting events, movies, or social media trends – unless you’re connected 24/7.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FoMO is an experimental first-person horror about paranoia, decay, and routines rotting before your eyes.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up. Work. Drink. Sleep.<br>Something broke, and now everything is wrong.<br>The apartment reeks of mold.<br>The bar is empty like a grave.<br>The office became a living maze that keeps shifting… and watching you.<br>No weapons.<br>No control.<br>Only escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FoMO is a suffocating horror focused on strangeness, sensory tension, and constant pursuit. Every run is unpredictable thanks to randomized mazes, nothing repeats, nobody escapes the same way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run. Hide. Endure the silence. Watch reality bend around you. The retro 3D pixel look isn’t nostalgia, it’s decay. Everything feels wrong. You’re trapped in a warped version of your own life. And a small decision can make everything worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental first-person horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird, decaying, unpredictable atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized mazes (every escape is unique)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on pursuit, evasion and hiding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distorted, uncomfortable retro visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound that amplifies paranoia and tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear narrative with consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily life turned into a nightmare</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/extras/95502aa2296edd681383391f4019394c.poster.avif?t=1771522941\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/extras/95502aa2296edd681383391f4019394c.webm?t=1771522941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/extras/95502aa2296edd681383391f4019394c.mp4?t=1771522941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does FoMO mean?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It stands for “Fear of Missing Out,” the anxiety that you’re missing out on exciting events, movies, or social media trends – unless you’re connected 24/7.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
